OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after five teenagers
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after five
OL,7,Fteenagers were injured in a crash.
OL,9,FSurrey Police said officers were called
OL,10,Fto reports of a crash involving a white
OL,11,FFiat Punto in Church Lane, Headley,
OL,12,Fnear Leatherhead, shortly before 03:30
OL,13,FBST.
OL,15,FFour 18-year-old passengers - two men
OL,16,Fand two women - were taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith serious injuries, said the force.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
