OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after five teenagers
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe male driver, 18, was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of driving while unfit
OL,8,Fthrough drink or drugs, driving while
OL,9,Fover the limit and causing serious
OL,10,Finjury by dangerous driving, it said.
OL,11,FHe was taken to hospital with minor
OL,12,Finjuries.
